{"ts": 0.167502, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 2 — GATE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n", "len": 127}
{"ts": 0.167941, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
