{"ts": 0.206669, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 2 — GATE TASK\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nInside the practice prompt, do these (in any order):\r\n\r\n  1. make a folder called \u001b[94mpractice\u001b[0m (inside this stage's folder)\r\n  2. cd into it\r\n  3. confirm you're inside it with \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThen type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[0m. I'll look for \u001b[94mpractice\u001b[0m on disk.\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mHint: \u001b[92mmkdir practice\u001b[0m\u001b[90m creates the folder.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 417}
{"ts": 0.207126, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
